title: "Terranoetis: A Real-Time Geospatial Intelligence and Analytical Simulation Platform"
abstract: >-
  Terranoetis is a real-time geospatial intelligence platform combining photorealistic
  CesiumJS 3D globe visualization with live environmental telemetry, physics simulations,
  and 150 computational engines implementing analytical models from primary scientific
  literature across 26 earth and atmospheric domains. Note: The mathematical equations and
  scientific models implemented in the platform remain the intellectual property of their
  respective published authors and are individually cited within the catalog.
